stateDiagram-v2
    %% Image turn tracker (writer/tool_images/turns.rs), drawn by hand: the TLC state space
    %% of every ToolImage config exceeds the 500-state chart budget.
    [*] --> Idle: read from offset 0
    [*] --> Unknown: read from a mid-file offset
    Unknown --> Restored: row preparation finds a durable span holding the row
    Unknown --> Open: prompt, assistant or turn start
    Idle --> Open: prompt, assistant or turn start
    Restored --> Idle: row offset reaches the durable Closed end
    Open --> Idle: native idle (unnamed or this turn's name), verified physical end
    Open --> Open: prompt inside the turn, another turn's named idle
    Restored --> Restored: prompt inside the turn, another turn's named idle
    Idle --> Idle: late result keeps its call's turn (memory or durable ImageCall)
